<p>SCP-2975, &quot;Another Sun.&quot; This was one of the most difficult things I've ever had to write. Thank you to my teammates for saving my sanity and making this not terrible (if it is terrible, the fault is mine).</p>
<p>Report any bugs or typos in the Twine choose-your-own-story file here, and I'll fix 'em (there shouldn't be any bugs/typos, but people can't edit Twine files like they can edit wikidot pages, so it has to be me!).</p>
<p>If you grew up reading the same books that I did, you'll recognize a few references, especially near the end of the After Action Report.</p>
<p>EDIT: Putting credit under spoiler tag. Read only after finishing the SCP!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Display&nbsp;Credit</a></div>
