<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The end of the After Action Report is heavily inspired by <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Underground Kingdom</span>, by Edward Packard, a Choose Your Own Adventure book which doesn't hold up perfectly today but which I still recommend.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
