			<div class="content" id="post-content-4045162">
									

<p>Honest question: If &quot;wizard&quot; is typically used for male-identifying magic users, and &quot;witch&quot; for female identifying&#8230; what's the term for neuter/bigender/whatever third-gender is implied by the nonbinary pronouns?</p>
<p>(I expect probably we take the Final Fantasy route and use &quot;Mage&quot;?)</p>
