<p>I enjoyed this a hell of a lot. The CYOA was fun, and it shows Sigma 3 really allows you to tell a story in settings and with characters that are entirely unique for a Foundation perspective. (i.e., you get to do all the fun hand/anart magic is real stuff while still rolling around as an MTF. Agent Navaro is fun and all, but this is neat.) I hope you keep writing with them.</p>
